  "error_direction": "conservative_toward_finding",
  "error_direction_rationale": "Computed max loss is rounded UP to the next minor unit and breaches use strict greater-than against declared levels, so the node may over-report a breach by one cent at an exact boundary but cannot miss one through rounding; a caller-declared max_loss_minor is used as given and is the caller's own assertion.",
